  "confidence": "high",
  "decision_summary": "Pass. The query is a noscapine-like phthalideisoquinoline with favorable passive BBB properties, and multiple structurally related alkaloids were directly measured to cross the BBB via brain tissue, CSF, or brain/plasma equilibration studies. No credible evidence indicates inadequate CNS access.",
